{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_21\">Problem 21</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 21\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the smallest positive odd integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32afa5bee94da793829f1e5fa74e429a9a68a64a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1/7}2^{3/7}\\cdots2^{(2n+1)/7}$\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" /> is greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />? \n(In the product the denominators of the exponents are all sevens, and the numerators are the successive odd integers from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/639e85fa2f2bb450812e9c9de2067851e11a04d1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"53\" height=\"15\" />.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/9/bc94561c3697589dc330b9511fc524a3b1844a10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }7\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }9\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }11\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }17\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"380\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Combine the terms in the product to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/c/95cc343ad63a9b543eb41fe10ae38ff49e358574.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{\\frac{1+3+5+ \\dots +(2n-1)+(2n+1)}{7}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"160\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>The exponent can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/5/045eb282b56c9e7d3de3e4e146af0ae755e25130.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1+3+5+ \\dots +(2n-1)+(2n+1)}{7} \\Rightarrow \\frac{\\frac{n(1+(2n+1))}{2}}{7} \\Rightarrow \\frac{n^2}{7}.\\]\" width=\"460\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p>We want this inequality to be true with the smallest positive odd integer value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faee6e3a1d5f15200d7b99c0023e73370f3f6e3d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^{\\frac{n^2}{7}} &gt; 1000.\\]\" width=\"90\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Now, let's test the answer choices. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/f/f7f0f830b5b25ea929198068e407e8c9f62f56c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/b/b5b718e094497a6d41904242afec2cb8ebb6d03f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{49/7}=2^{7}&lt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"19\" />. For <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/f/18fb781bb0840e30c7a894eac0d3a0f67fcd3157.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/4/dc437e56b103ff5b3486cf3dfb5f01a2bf043384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{81/7}&gt;2^{10}&gt;1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nSo our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/b/e3b09e18d34b772e1ca5645f83afb72619997262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />. ~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Jiang147369\" title=\"User:Jiang147369\">jiang147369</a>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center